## Skills Demonstrated

- Nmap network reconnaissance and service fingerprinting
- Wireshark/tshark packet analysis with statistical baselining
- Risk assessment with CVSS-style severity rating
- Evidence chain of custody (SHA-256 hashing)
- Forensic report writing in industry-standard format
- Passive monitoring vs. active scanning trade-offs
- MITRE ATT&CK technique mapping

